  <div class="wrap"><div class="leader-demo">
    <article class="leader-card" aria-labelledby="hunter-kiker-name">
      <div class="leader-card__media"><img src="assets/photos/optimized/hunter-portrait-900.jpg" alt="Portrait of Hunter Kiker" width="675" height="900" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="leader-card__identity">
        <h3 id="hunter-kiker-name">Hunter Kiker</h3>
        <p>Owner · Third generation</p>
      </div>
      <button class="leader-card__toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hunter-kiker-profile" title="View Hunter Kiker profile">{% include '_partials/kiker-icon' with { name: 'verified' } only %}<span class="sr-only">View Hunter Kiker profile</span></button>
      <div class="leader-card__overlay" id="hunter-kiker-profile">
        <span class="eyebrow">Meet the Owner</span>
        <h3>Hunter Kiker</h3>
        <p class="leader-card__role">Owner · Third generation</p>
        <p class="leader-card__bio">Hunter has worked this yard since he was a teenager. He is hands-on, straight with people, and accountable for how Kiker's treats every customer.</p>
        <dl class="leader-card__facts">
          <div class="leader-card__fact"><dt>Generation</dt><dd>3rd</dd></div>
          <div class="leader-card__fact"><dt>Role</dt><dd>Owner</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <span class="leader-card__value">Own it · Do right</span>
      </div>
    </article>
    <div class="leader-guidance">
      <span class="eyebrow">Meet the Owner</span>
      <h2>The guy behind every offer</h2>
      <p class="lead-p">Hunter has worked this yard since he was a teenager. He's hands-on, straight with people, and accountable for how Kiker's treats every customer — whether you're selling a car or pulling a part.</p>
      <p class="quote">"We make it simple and we do it right — fair cash, paperwork handled, the car recycled the proper way."</p>
      <div class="sig">Hunter Kiker</div>
      <div class="role">Owner · Kiker's U-Pull-It · Licensed Florida salvage dealer</div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</section>

<!-- MILESTONES -->
<section class="sec tight">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">Milestones</span><h2>Still on the same ground</h2></div>
    <div class="milestone-grid">
      <article class="milestone-card"><span class="milestone-card__number">1972</span><span class="milestone-card__label">Land Bought</span><span class="milestone-card__detail">The same Pensacola ground Kiker's works today.</span></article>
      <article class="milestone-card"><span class="milestone-card__number">2001</span><span class="milestone-card__label">Reopened</span><span class="milestone-card__detail">The family returned as Kiker's U-Pull-It.</span></article>
      <article class="milestone-card"><span class="milestone-card__number">3rd</span><span class="milestone-card__label">Generation</span><span class="milestone-card__detail">Hunter carries the family business forward.</span></article>
      <article class="milestone-card"><span class="milestone-card__number">25</span><span class="milestone-card__label">Years Serving</span><span class="milestone-card__detail">Local, licensed, and still accountable.</span></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- COMMUNITY / GIVING BACK (dark) -->
<section class="sec story">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="story-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow on-ink">Giving Back</span>
      <h2>Good for the <em>community.</em></h2>
      <p class="lede">We donate vehicles to the local fire department for extrication training — practice that can save a loved one's life one day. And every car we take in gets recycled the right way: copper and metal recovered, fluids handled properly, good parts going on to keep another family on the road.</p>
      <p class="body">End of life giving life. It's not just fluff — it's how we've always done it.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="site-photo site-photo--landscape"><img src="assets/photos/optimized/kikers-team-1600.jpg" alt="The Kiker's team together outside the Pensacola yard" width="1600" height="871" loading="lazy"></figure>
  </div></div>
</section>

<div class="ecostrip"><div class="wrap"><span class="ic">♻️</span><span class="t">Every vehicle is recycled the right way — good parts reused, metals recovered, fluids handled properly.</span></div></div>

<div class="race-rule"></div>
<section class="finalcta"><div class="wrap">
  <div><h2>Pensacola's yard for 25 years.</h2><p>Sell a car, pull a part, or just come say hi. We're the people you actually know.</p></div>
